    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable over three months; no fever or new fatigue</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision with reading glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cold resolved; no hearing difficulty in conversation</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, fainting, or lightheadedness on donepezil</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cough resolved; no breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, diarrhea, or loss of appetite on donepezil</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Gets up once a night to pass urine; no incontinence</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain or falls</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Known memory loss, unchanged by his caregiver&apos;s account; no night-time confusion since the antihistamine was stopped</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood fair to good; no hallucinations or agitation; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No thirst or frequent urination</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

