    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>The advance care planning completed six weeks ago was reviewed with him and his caregiver. His health care agent remains the same and is recorded in the chart, not named here. He confirmed that what matters most to him is staying at home among gardens and trees for as long as it is safe, and being told the truth about his condition. No decisions were changed. The plan will be revisited at the yearly dementia review and at any change in stage. [S]</paragraph></text>

